      "text": "8.3 Implementing Flash Attention & 8.4 The evolution of Flash Attention\n-> exmaine naive attention before fused Flash Attention to resolve it and see how the work distrubiton strategy, loop hiearchy, and WMMA tesnor cores all fit together\n\n8.3.1 Dissecting the naive implementaiton `book.cu/6_flash/kernels/naive.cu.`\n\n",
